  "description": "Scheduled jobs for the Webority fleet. Job schedules: one timer per schedule runs each step whose own six-field UTC cron is due, once, with catch-up, its own DI scope and a run row per step, behind a state store the host supplies. DestructiveRunGuard: one brake for jobs that delete data or remove access, refusing an empty population or a plan over its caps, for the whole plan.",
